        "value": "<p><div class=\"et_pb_section et_pb_section_4 et_pb_with_background et_section_regular\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_row et_pb_row_4\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_4  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_4  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong>Welcome to the Term 2 In Brief newsletter</strong>. </span></p>\n<p>Welcome to the latest In Brief newsletter, where we share updates and information to support you and your school.</p>\n<p>This term, discover how your feedback helps shape continuous improvements, dive into the world of digital identity, and stay informed about upcoming events we&#8217;re attending.</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">As always, if you have any questions or if there is anything we can help you with, please contact our Customer Support team on 0800 532 764 or <a href=\"\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">support@n4l.co.nz</a>.</span></p>\n<p><span></span></p></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_section et_pb_section_5 et_pb_with_background et_section_regular\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_row et_pb_row_5\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_5  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_5  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p><span style=\"color: #993366;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><b>MyN4L</b></span></span></p>\n<p>Free smart and simple tools to help manage your school&#8217;s online environment</p>\n<p>Managing your school\u2019s digital environment has got a whole lot easier with MyN4L, our free self-service platform.</p>\n<p>Whether you need to block or unblock websites, view quarantined emails and safely release legitimate ones, or check on your network performance and equipment &#8211; MyN4L is designed to give you more visibility to see what&#8217;s happening on your network, and more control to make changes in a few clicks.</p>\n<p><strong> <a href=\"https://my.n4l.co.nz/register\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Sign up for MyN4L today</a>.\u00a0</strong></p></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_section et_pb_section_6 et_pb_with_background et_section_regular\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_row et_pb_row_6\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_6  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_6  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p><span style=\"color: #993366;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><b><span>Your voice, real impact: see what changed thanks to your feedback</span></b></span></span></p>\n<p>We know that school leaders are busy, and surveys can sometimes feel like \u201cone more thing\u201d in a packed day. But when you share your experiences with us, it creates a direct line from your classroom to our product and support teams, influencing the changes you see in the services you use every day. <a href=\"https://www.n4l.co.nz/your-voice-real-impact-see-what-changed-thanks-to-your-feedback/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Read now</strong><span>.</span></a></p></div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_image et_pb_image_0\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.n4l.co.nz/your-voice-real-impact-see-what-changed-thanks-to-your-feedback/\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"et_pb_image_wrap \"><img alt=\"Feedback loop blog graphic\" class=\"wp-image-11605\" height=\"1706\" src=\"https://www.n4l.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/Feedback-loop-scaled.jpg\" title=\"Feedback loop blog graphic\" width=\"2560\" /></span></a>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_row et_pb_row_7\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_7  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_7  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p><span style=\"color: #993366;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><b><span>Why identity is the foundation of modern cybersecurity in schools</span></b></span></span></p>\n<p>Most cyber incidents start with a compromised identity. To protect your school, you need to be sure the right people are on the right devices. We break down why identity is the &#8220;digital passport&#8221; for your network and why it\u2019s the essential foundation for keeping your learning environment safe. <strong><a href=\"https://www.n4l.co.nz/why-identity-is-the-foundation-of-modern-cybersecurity-in-schools/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Learn more.</a></strong></p></div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_image et_pb_image_1\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.n4l.co.nz/why-identity-is-the-foundation-of-modern-cybersecurity-in-schools/\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"et_pb_image_wrap \"><img alt=\"Animation of student, padlock and student with laptop\" class=\"wp-image-11690\" height=\"1706\" src=\"https://www.n4l.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Identity-blog-graphic-scaled.jpg\" title=\"Animation of student, padlock and student with laptop\" width=\"2560\" /></span></a>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_row et_pb_row_8\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_8  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_8  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p><span style=\"color: #993366;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><b><span>Want to know more about what N4L can do for your school?</span></b></span></span></p>\n<p>Watch this video to discover our range of products and services and how they come together to help keep your school&#8217;s network safer and more secure. <strong><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8PcVL5ipvUs&amp;t=1s\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Watch this video.</a></strong></p></div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_image et_pb_image_2\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8PcVL5ipvUs&#038;t=1s\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"et_pb_image_wrap \"><img alt=\"Internet security vs Wifi security animated blog image\" class=\"wp-image-11862\" height=\"1080\" src=\"https://www.n4l.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Feature-panels-core-products-and-services.jpg\" title=\"Feature-panels-core-products-and-services\" width=\"1440\" /></span></a>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_section et_pb_section_7 et_pb_with_background et_section_regular\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_row et_pb_row_9\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_9  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_9  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p><strong style=\"color: #993366; font-size: 18px;\"><span>Events on the horizon</span></strong></p>\n<p>We\u2019ve thoroughly enjoyed connecting with many of you at events so far this year. With more on the horizon, we\u2019re looking forward to catching up in person and hearing how things are going. Pop by the N4L stand to chat with our team and, while you&#8217;re there, try your hand at winning a morning tea voucher for your school! We&#8217;ll be at the following events:</p>\n<p><strong>NZSBA &#8211; NZ School Boards Association Conference</strong><br />Friday 17 &#8211; Sunday 19 July | Aotea Centre, Auckland</p>\n<p><strong>ICP &#8211; NZ Principals\u2019 Federation Conference</strong><br />Wednesday 16 &#8211; Friday 18 September | New Zealand International Convention Centre (NZICC), Auckland</p></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_section et_pb_section_8 et_clickable et_pb_with_background et_section_regular\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_row et_pb_row_10\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_3 et_pb_column_10  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_blurb et_pb_blurb_0  et_pb_text_align_center  et_pb_blurb_position_top et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_blurb_content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_main_blurb_image\"><span class=\"et_pb_image_wrap et_pb_only_image_mode_wrap\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"et-waypoint et_pb_animation_top et_pb_animation_top_tablet et_pb_animation_top_phone wp-image-6320\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.n4l.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Websites.png\" width=\"343\" /></span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_blurb_container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_blurb_description\"><p><b>8.55 B<br /></b><strong>Websites blocked</strong></p>\n<p><strong></strong></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_3 et_pb_column_11  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_blurb et_pb_blurb_1  et_pb_text_align_center  et_pb_blurb_position_top et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_blurb_content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_main_blurb_image\"><span class=\"et_pb_image_wrap et_pb_only_image_mode_wrap\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"et-waypoint et_pb_animation_top et_pb_animation_top_tablet et_pb_animation_top_phone wp-image-6323\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.n4l.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Security-threats.png\" width=\"343\" /></span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_blurb_container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_blurb_description\"><p><strong>8.84 B <br />Total threats blocked\u00a0</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"></span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_3 et_pb_column_12  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_blurb et_pb_blurb_2  et_pb_text_align_center  et_pb_blurb_position_top et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_blurb_content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_main_blurb_image\"><span class=\"et_pb_image_wrap et_pb_only_image_mode_wrap\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"et-waypoint et_pb_animation_top et_pb_animation_top_tablet et_pb_animation_top_phone wp-image-6321\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.n4l.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/Web-data.png\" width=\"343\" /></span></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_blurb_container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_blurb_description\"><p><strong>9.91 PB <br /></strong><strong>Website data usage\u00a0</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"></span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_row et_pb_row_11\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_13  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_10  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><h6 style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>NB: The above statistics are between 1 January and 31 March 2026</em></h6>\n<p><em><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"></span></i></em></p></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div></p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.n4l.co.nz/term-two-2026-n4l-in-brief-blog/\">Term two 2026 N4L IN BRIEF blog</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.n4l.co.nz\">Network for Learning | N4L</a>.</p>"
